# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0083.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Raw Dataset -> Remove Invalid Rows
Remove Invalid Rows -> Handle Missing Values
Handle Missing Values -> Replace Infinite Values
Replace Infinite Values -> Select Numerical Features
Select Numerical Features -> Remove Constant Features
Remove Constant Features -> Feature Alignment
Feature Alignment -> StandardScaler - fit on benign-train only
StandardScaler - fit on benign-train only -> PCA
